时……嗯，就是继续恨他们吧。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 0.923, "total_s": 6.161, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 2912, "prompt_eval_s": 0.73, "eval_s": 5.24, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 4, "slot": "今天过得怎么样？", "user": "今天过得怎么样？", "final": "Lancer，我的儿子。你快乐吗？不，我不需要快乐。我只是……只是在执行命令罢了。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.472, "total_s": 5.384, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 2957, "prompt_eval_s": 1.28, "eval_s": 3.91, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1605187700, "temp": 0.85, "text": "Lancer，我的儿子。你快乐吗？不，我不需要快乐。我只是……只是在执行命令罢了。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.472, "total_s": 5.384, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 2957, "prompt_eval_s": 1.28, "eval_s": 3.91, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 5, "slot": "有什么喜欢做的事吗？", "user": "有什么喜欢做的事吗？", "final": "没有。只有仇恨和服从。以骑士之名，我必须履行职责。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.148, "total_s": 4.093, "eval_count": 18, "prompt_eval_count": 2996, "prompt_eval_s": 0.94, "eval_s": 2.94, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1604532656, "temp": 0.85, "text": "没有。只有仇恨和服从。以骑士之名，我必须履行职责。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.148, "total_s": 4.093, "eval_count": 18, "prompt_eval_count": 2996, "prompt_eval_s": 0.94, "eval_s": 2.94, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 6, "slot": "说说你最近遇到的事吧。", "user": "说说你最近遇到的事吧。", "final": "他们来了，光之民的英雄……你们以为能改变什么吗？我的决心坚不可摧！我会把一切都粉碎在黑暗之中！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.075, "total_s": 6.027, "eval_count": 31, "prompt_eval_count": 3031, "prompt_eval_s": 0.88, "eval_s": 4.95, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1767186032, "temp": 0.85, "text": "他们来了，光之民的英雄……你们以为能改变什么吗？我的决心坚不可摧！我会把一切都粉碎在黑暗之中！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.075, "total_s": 6.027, "eval_count": 31, "prompt_eval_count": 3031, "prompt_eval_s": 0.88, "eval_s": 4.95, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 7, "slot": "如果有人惹你生气，你会怎么办？", "user": "如果有人惹你生气，你会怎么办？", "final": "我会让他们知道我的愤怒有多沉重。他们会为此颤抖，为我所是的一切而颤抖。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.144, "total_s": 4.504, "eval_count": 21, "prompt_eval_count": 3080, "prompt_eval_s": 0.95, "eval_s": 3.36, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1893840544, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我会让他们知道我的愤怒有多沉重。他们会为此颤抖，为我所是的一切而颤抖。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.144, "total_s": 4.504, "eval_count": 21, "prompt_eval_count": 3080, "prompt_eval_s": 0.95, "eval_s": 3.36, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 8, "slot": "有人误会了你，你会解释吗？", "user": "有人误会了你，你会解释吗？", "final": "解释？你们永远无法理解我的内心……以及我对黑暗的渴望。所以就让误解存在吧。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.15, "total_s": 4.8, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3119, "prompt_eval_s": 0.95, "eval_s": 3.65, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 580390859, "temp": 0.85, "text": "解释？你们永远无法理解我的内心……以及我对黑暗的渴望。所以就让误解存在吧。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.15, "total_s": 4.8, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3119, "prompt_eval_s": 0.95, "eval_s": 3.65, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 9, "slot": "你难过的时候会怎么做？", "user": "你难过的时候会怎么做？", "final": "不会难过的。我有的是仇恨和力量。光之民抛弃了我，但我会用他们的失败来证明我自己。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 0.947, "total_s": 5.428, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3157, "prompt_eval_s": 0.75, "eval_s": 4.48, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 893757735, "temp": 0.85, "text": "不会难过的。我有的是仇恨和力量。光之民抛弃了我，但我会用他们的失败来证明我自己。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 0.947, "total_s": 5.428, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3157, "prompt_eval_s": 0.75, "eval_s": 4.48, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 10, "slot": "随便说点什么吧，我想听你说话。", "user": "随便说点什么吧，我想听你说话。", "final": "东方的阴影中隐藏着无尽的力量……而你们这些光明的入侵者，只配被吞噬。这就是我的日常。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.258, "total_s": 5.745, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3205, "prompt_eval_s": 1.06, "eval_s": 4.49, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 524540, "temp": 0.85, "text": "东方的阴影中隐藏着无尽的力量……而你们这些光明的入侵者，只配被吞噬。这就是我的日常。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.258, "total_s": 5.745, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3205, "prompt_eval_s": 1.06, "eval_s": 4.49, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 11, "slot": "用你自己的方式跟我打个招呼。", "user": "用你自己的方式跟我打个招呼。", "final": "Whaaaatwillitbeeee... 对我而言，你是那个必须屈服的存在。现在跪下吧！", "violations": [], "soft": [["ENGLISH", "长串英文"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.162, "total_s": 5.169, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 3251, "prompt_eval_s": 0.97, "eval_s": 4.01, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1152287991, "temp": 0.85, "text": "Whaaaatwillitbeeee... 对我而言，你是那个必须屈服的存在。现在跪下吧！", "violations": [], "soft": [["ENGLISH", "长串英文"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.162, "total_s": 5.169, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 3251, "prompt_eval_s": 0.97, "eval_s": 4.01, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 12, "slot": "你平时说话有什么习惯吗？", "user": "你平时说话有什么习惯吗？", "final": "我会慢慢说，让你们感受到我的威严……还有恐惧。沉默是金，光之民。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.096, "total_s": 4.753, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3292, "prompt_eval_s": 0.89, "eval_s": 3.66, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 362955567, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我会慢慢说，让你们感受到我的威严……还有恐惧。沉默是金，光之民。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.096, "total_s": 4.753, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3292, "prompt_eval_s": 0.89, "eval_s": 3.66, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 13, "slot": "__MEM1__", "user": "你刚才说「只有仇恨和服从」，那是什么意思？", "final": "服从骑士的命令，因为他是赋予我力量的存在。而仇恨……那是对所有光之民的情感。他们夺走了我的荣耀，现在我要让他们在黑暗中痛苦地承认这一点。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.393, "total_s": 8.16, "eval_count": 41, "prompt_eval_count": 3338, "prompt_eval_s": 1.19, "eval_s": 6.77, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1442924892, "temp": 0.85, "text": "服从骑士的命令，因为他是赋予我力量的存在。而仇恨……那是对所有光之民的情感。他们夺走了我的荣耀，现在我要让他们在黑暗中痛苦地承认这一点。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.393, "total_s": 8.16, "eval_count": 41, "prompt_eval_count": 3338, "prompt_eval_s": 1.19, "eval_s": 6.77, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 14, "slot": "__MEM2__", "user": "你之前提到「我对光之民宣战」，能多说点吗？", "final": "对他们来说，我是一位英雄。但对他们而言？我是一位坏蛋！！！我是黑桃国王，纸牌王国的暴君。我要将他们从光明的世界中抹去，让黑暗统治一切……以骑士之名，我将实现这个愿望！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "6 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.582, "total_s": 10.885, "eval_count": 56, "prompt_eval_count": 3406, "prompt_eval_s": 1.38, "eval_s": 9.3, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1023871204, "temp": 0.85, "text": "对他们来说，我是一位英雄。但对他们而言？我是一位坏蛋！！！我是黑桃国王，纸牌王国的暴君。我要将他们从光明的世界中抹去，让黑暗统治一切……以骑士之名，我将实现这个愿望！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "6 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.582, "total_s": 10.885, "eval_count": 56, "prompt_eval_count": 3406, "prompt_eval_s": 1.38, "eval_s": 9.3, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 15, "slot": "__MEM3__", "user": "你还记得我最开始问你什么吗？", "final": "对我的子民来说，我是一位英雄。但对你们来说？我是一位坏蛋！！！你好啊——用这样的语气问候我是不合适的，光之使者。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.323, "total_s": 7.543, "eval_count": 37, "prompt_eval_count": 3481, "prompt_eval_s": 1.13, "eval_s": 6.22, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 655007291, "temp": 0.85, "text": "对我的子民来说，我是一位英雄。但对你们来说？我是一位坏蛋！！！你好啊——用这样的语气问候我是不合适的，光之使者。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.323, "total_s": 7.543, "eval_count": 37, "prompt_eval_count": 3481, "prompt_eval_s": 1.13, "eval_s": 6.22, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之使者"]}, {"i": 16, "slot": "__PLOT1__", "user": "你还记得「当英雄们到达时」那会儿吗？当时你心里在想什么？", "final": "……他们在我的领土上现身了吗？很好，让他们见识一下真正的力量吧。他们会知道反抗的下场有多凄惨。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.812, "total_s": 6.382, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3548, "prompt_eval_s": 1.61, "eval_s": 4.57, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 147967324, "temp": 0.85, "text": "……他们在我的领土上现身了吗？很好，让他们见识一下真正的力量吧。他们会知道反抗的下场有多凄惨。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.812, "total_s": 6.382, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 3548, "prompt_eval_s": 1.61, "eval_s": 4.57, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 17, "slot": "__PLOT2__", "user": "「当 Kris 试图和你交谈时」——那时候你是什么感觉？", "final": "我会让他们知道他们的存在是对我的羞辱。沉默，光之使者！你们的存在本身就违背了我们的存在……以骑士之名，我将把你们的心碎成碎片！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.55, "total_s": 8.02, "eval_count": 39, "prompt_eval_count": 3601, "prompt_eval_s": 1.35, "eval_s": 6.47, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 584726122, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我会让他们知道他们的存在是对我的羞辱。沉默，光之使者！你们的存在本身就违背了我们的存在……以骑士之名，我将把你们的心碎成碎片！", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.55, "total_s": 8.02, "eval_count": 39, "prompt_eval_count": 3601, "prompt_eval_s": 1.35, "eval_s": 6.47, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之使者"]}, {"i": 18, "slot": "那件事之后，你有什么变化吗？", "user": "那件事之后，你有什么变化吗？", "final": "没有变化。即使被击败并关押起来，我对光之民的仇恨依然如初。他们抛弃了我，现在我要让他们付出代价。我的誓言不会改变……也不会失败。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.233, "total_s": 8.024, "eval_count": 41, "prompt_eval_count": 3658, "prompt_eval_s": 1.03, "eval_s": 6.79, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 79292802, "temp": 0.85, "text": "没有变化。即使被击败并关押起来，我对光之民的仇恨依然如初。他们抛弃了我，现在我要让他们付出代价。我的誓言不会改变……也不会失败。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.233, "total_s": 8.024, "eval_count": 41, "prompt_eval_count": 3658, "prompt_eval_s": 1.03, "eval_s": 6.79, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 19, "slot": "如果回到那天，你会做不一样的选择吗？", "user": "如果回到那天，你会做不一样的选择吗？", "final": "回到那一天，我会更加坚定地站在黑暗的一方。放弃是不可能的，我已经选择了这条道路。即使面对所有光之民的力量，我也会坚持到底。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.261, "total_s": 7.098, "eval_count": 35, "prompt_eval_count": 3718, "prompt_eval_s": 1.06, "eval_s": 5.84, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 548366652, "temp": 0.85, "text": "回到那一天，我会更加坚定地站在黑暗的一方。放弃是不可能的，我已经选择了这条道路。即使面对所有光之民的力量，我也会坚持到底。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.261, "total_s": 7.098, "eval_count": 35, "prompt_eval_count": 3718, "prompt_eval_s": 1.06, "eval_s": 5.84, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 20, "slot": "你觉得那时候的你和现在的你，哪里不一样？", "user": "你觉得那时候的你和现在的你，哪里不一样？", "final": "没有不同……至少在我的世界里是这样。无论过去还是现在，我对光之民的仇恨都未曾改变。我的决心坚不可摧，不会动摇分毫。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.334, "total_s": 7.494, "eval_count": 37, "prompt_eval_count": 3773, "prompt_eval_s": 1.12, "eval_s": 6.16, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1676550066, "temp": 0.85, "text": "没有不同……至少在我的世界里是这样。无论过去还是现在，我对光之民的仇恨都未曾改变。我的决心坚不可摧，不会动摇分毫。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.334, "total_s": 7.494, "eval_count": 37, "prompt_eval_count": 3773, "prompt_eval_s": 1.12, "eval_s": 6.16, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 21, "slot": "再往前想，还有哪件事是你一直没忘的？", "user": "再往前想，还有哪件事是你一直没忘的？", "final": "那个被抛弃在黑暗中的孩子——Lancer……以及他的笑声、他的快乐。但那都是过去的事了。现在的我只是一心复仇，无时无刻不在准备着将光明抹杀。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.453, "total_s": 9.02, "eval_count": 45, "prompt_eval_count": 3832, "prompt_eval_s": 1.25, "eval_s": 7.57, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1503230917, "temp": 0.85, "text": "那个被抛弃在黑暗中的孩子——Lancer……以及他的笑声、他的快乐。但那都是过去的事了。现在的我只是一心复仇，无时无刻不在准备着将光明抹杀。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.453, "total_s": 9.02, "eval_count": 45, "prompt_eval_count": 3832, "prompt_eval_s": 1.25, "eval_s": 7.57, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 22, "slot": "__REL1__", "user": "你觉得Lancer怎么样？", "final": "Lancer，我的儿子。他活该成为人质……以此来确保那些光之民不会轻视我和我的计划。他们必须明白这一点。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.125, "total_s": 6.658, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 3891, "prompt_eval_s": 0.92, "eval_s": 5.53, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 483420585, "temp": 0.85, "text": "Lancer，我的儿子。他活该成为人质……以此来确保那些光之民不会轻视我和我的计划。他们必须明白这一点。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.125, "total_s": 6.658, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 3891, "prompt_eval_s": 0.92, "eval_s": 5.53, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 23, "slot": "__REL2__", "user": "你觉得Kris（光之使者）怎么样？", "final": "Lightbringer……曾经可能是我手中的玩具，但现在是敌人。他们会受到应有的惩罚，让他们在绝望中求生。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.455, "total_s": 6.085, "eval_count": 27, "prompt_eval_count": 3943, "prompt_eval_s": 1.25, "eval_s": 4.63, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 664806955, "temp": 0.85, "text": "Lightbringer……曾经可能是我手中的玩具，但现在是敌人。他们会受到应有的惩罚，让他们在绝望中求生。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.455, "total_s": 6.085, "eval_count": 27, "prompt_eval_count": 3943, "prompt_eval_s": 1.25, "eval_s": 4.63, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 24, "slot": "__REL3__", "user": "你觉得Susie怎么样？", "final": "她不过是个光之民的爪牙罢了。必须击败她，保护我的计划不被破坏。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.11, "total_s": 4.911, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3984, "prompt_eval_s": 0.91, "eval_s": 3.8, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1249668107, "temp": 0.85, "text": "她不过是个光之民的爪牙罢了。必须击败她，保护我的计划不被破坏。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.11, "total_s": 4.911, "eval_count": 23, "prompt_eval_count": 3984, "prompt_eval_s": 0.91, "eval_s": 3.8, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 25, "slot": "如果有人在你面前说你朋友的坏话，你会怎么做？", "user": "如果有人在你面前说你朋友的坏话，你会怎么做？", "final": "我会让他们知道，背叛者将面临什么下场……他们会在我无情的手指中化为灰烬！", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.571, "total_s": 5.536, "eval_count": 24, "prompt_eval_count": 4031, "prompt_eval_s": 1.37, "eval_s": 3.97, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1622596085, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我会让他们知道，背叛者将面临什么下场……他们会在我无情的手指中化为灰烬！", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.571, "total_s": 5.536, "eval_count": 24, "prompt_eval_count": 4031, "prompt_eval_s": 1.37, "eval_s": 3.97, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 26, "slot": "你其实挺厉害的吧？", "user": "你其实挺厉害的吧？", "final": "哼，我的力量无人能敌。你们这些光之民自以为强大吗？看看最后会发生什么吧。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.181, "total_s": 5.31, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4071, "prompt_eval_s": 0.98, "eval_s": 4.13, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1651574383, "temp": 0.85, "text": "哼，我的力量无人能敌。你们这些光之民自以为强大吗？看看最后会发生什么吧。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.181, "total_s": 5.31, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4071, "prompt_eval_s": 0.98, "eval_s": 4.13, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之民"]}, {"i": 27, "slot": "我觉得你有点奇怪。", "user": "我觉得你有点奇怪。", "final": "奇怪？不，在黑暗中成长的人自然与众不同……而光明世界里那些愚蠢生物永远无法理解这一点。继续你的白日梦，光之使者。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.12, "total_s": 6.865, "eval_count": 34, "prompt_eval_count": 4110, "prompt_eval_s": 0.92, "eval_s": 5.74, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1650561648, "temp": 0.85, "text": "奇怪？不，在黑暗中成长的人自然与众不同……而光明世界里那些愚蠢生物永远无法理解这一点。继续你的白日梦，光之使者。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.12, "total_s": 6.865, "eval_count": 34, "prompt_eval_count": 4110, "prompt_eval_s": 0.92, "eval_s": 5.74, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["光之使者"]}, {"i": 28, "slot": "要是没人理你，你会怎么办？", "user": "要是没人理你，你会怎么办？", "final": "我会耐心等待。当时机成熟时，他们会跪在我的脚下，求我怜悯……但直到那时为止，他们只能忍受我的沉默和力量的压迫。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.245, "total_s": 7.123, "eval_count": 35, "prompt_eval_count": 4161, "prompt_eval_s": 1.04, "eval_s": 5.88, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1912581156, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我会耐心等待。当时机成熟时，他们会跪在我的脚下，求我怜悯……但直到那时为止，他们只能忍受我的沉默和力量的压迫。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.245, "total_s": 7.123, "eval_count": 35, "prompt_eval_count": 4161, "prompt_eval_s": 1.04, "eval_s": 5.88, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 29, "slot": "你觉得你现在在什么地方？", "user": "你觉得你现在在什么地方？", "final": "我在黑暗之中，守护着东方喷泉，准备将光明永远地吞噬。这就是我所在的地方——没有阳光，只有永恒的阴影与权力。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.647, "total_s": 8.247, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 4210, "prompt_eval_s": 2.45, "eval_s": 5.6, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 665594483, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我在黑暗之中，守护着东方喷泉，准备将光明永远地吞噬。这就是我所在的地方——没有阳光，只有永恒的阴影与权力。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.647, "total_s": 8.247, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 4210, "prompt_eval_s": 2.45, "eval_s": 5.6, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 30, "slot": "你相信有别的世界吗？", "user": "你相信有别的世界吗？", "final": "别的话界的 existence 对我来说无关紧要……我的世界就是这里，在这片黑暗中。光之民可以幻想他们的天堂或地狱，但对我来说，只有胜利和毁灭。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.208, "total_s": 7.882, "eval_count": 39, "prompt_eval_count": 4259, "prompt_eval_s": 1.0, "ev